  "rationale": "The batch repeatedly exposes weak lexical continuations in the closing phrase “Until next time!”: the existing roots for next and ! have only tiny weights, and time is poorly supported after next. Add bounded suffix rules for these visible contexts. The batch also contains “a little village” and “The End”; local phrase rules raise the observed continuations without asserting anything from later words. These lexical repairs may be too narrow, and next/time or punctuation have valid alternatives in other contexts; the replay gate should assess whether these additions materially harm earlier behavior. No held-out evaluation is available.",
